furgonetka-api-php
PHP client for the Furgonetka.pl REST API

Copyright 2026 Very Code
Homepage: https://very-code.com
Repository: https://github.com/very-code-com/furgonetka-api-php

This product provides an open-source PHP client for the Furgonetka.pl REST API,
covering OAuth2 authorisation, carrier price comparison, shipment creation and
ordering, labels and shipping documents, courier pickups, cancellation,
tracking, pickup-point search, returns and readdressing, file uploads, the
address book, notification settings, webhooks and the account balance, across
the carriers Furgonetka.pl brokers.

